# Ceilings for the estimated usage meters, in the weighted metering unit —
# input + output + cacheCreation + (cacheRead × 0.02). See
# docs/features/usage-limit-meters.md, and regenerate these figures for your own
# device with `node scripts/derive-metering-weight.mjs`.
#
# A ceiling set too HIGH makes the meter read usage too LOW, so prefer the
# measured figure over a generous guess. The values below are this device's,
# rounded down from what Anthropic's own utilization headers imply (~19M per
# 5-hour window, ~154M per week).
USAGE_LIMIT_5H=18m
USAGE_LIMIT_WEEK=150m
